            "description": "# OpenDAL Python Binding\n\nThis crate intends to build a native python binding.\n\n## Building\n\nInstall `maturin`:\n\n```shell\npip install maturin\n```\n\nSetup virtualenv:\n\n```shell\nvirtualenv venv\n```\n\nActivate venv:\n\n```shell\nsource venv/bin/activate\n````\n\nBuild bindings:\n\n```shell\nmaturin develop\n```\n\nRunning some tests:\n\n```shell\npip install -r test_requirements.txt\npytest\n```\n\n",
